      "content": "rest doesnt really do it tho. i've tried sleeping, i've tried taking time off. but the pile just keeps getting bigger. every time i catch my breath, the debt and the expectations just crush me all over again. it feels like there's no actual exit, just a slower version of the same misery. i feel like i'm stuck in a trap that has no way out.",
